    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bena Yelushalema bakahingisha Ahazaya, muanʼa mukala wa mukelenge, mu bukelenge mu muaba wandi; bualu bua bantu bakalua ne Bena Alabâ mu tshitudilu, bakashiha bakulu bandi bonso. Nunku Ahazaya, muana wa Yeholama, mukelenge wa Yuda, wakakokesha bantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahazaya wakadi ne bidimu makumi anai ne bibidi hakabangeye kukokesha; wakakokesha mu Yelushalema tshidimu tshimue; dina dia mamu wandi diakadi Atalaya, muana mukashi wa Omeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakenda mu nshila ya bakadi mu nsubu wa Ahaba; bualu bua mamu wandi wakamulombola mua kuenza malu mabi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakenza malu mabi ku mesu kua Yehowa bu muakenza ba mu nsubu wa Ahaba; bualu bua bobo bakadi bafidi bandi ba meji bua kumubutula hakafua tatu wandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakalonda mei abo, wakaya ne Yeholama, muana wa Ahaba, mukelenge wa Isalele, bua kuluangana ne Hazaele, mukelenge wa Sulia, ku Lamota-gilada; Bena Sulia bakataha Yolama mputa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakaya ku Yizelele bua kuondahisha mputa yandi yakamutahabo ku Lama hakadiye uluangana ne Hazaele, mukelenge wa Sulia. Ahazaya, muana wa Yeholama, mukelenge wa Yuda wakaya kumona Yeholama, muana wa Ahaba, ku Yizelele, bualu bua yeye wakadi usama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kubutuka kua Ahazaya kuakadi bua Nzambi, bualu bua yeye wakaya kudi Yolama; bualu bua hakafikeye kudiye, yeye wakaya ne Yeholama bua kuluangana ne Yehu, muana wa Nimishi, nguakelabo manyi ha mutu kudi Yehowa bua kubutuleye ba mu nsubu wa Ahaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakadi Yehu ulumbuluisha ba mu nsubu wa Ahaba, yeye wakasangana bantu banene bi Bena Yuda ne bana balume ba bana babo ne Ahazaya bakuatshile Ahazaya mudimu; yeye wakabashiha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakakeba Ahazaya; bakamukuata, musokome mu Samalea bakalua n andi kudi Yehu, yeye wakamushiha; bakamujika, bamba ne, Yeye udi muana wa Yehoshafata, nguakakeba Yehowa ne mutshima wandi wonso. Ba mu nsubu wa Ahazaya kabakadi ne bukole bua kujadika nʼabu bukelenge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakamona Atalaya, mamu wa Ahazaya, ne muanʼandi udi mufue yeye wakajuka, wakashiha bana balume bonso ba bakelenge ba Bena Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi Yehoshabata, muana mukashi wa mukelenge, wakangata Yoasha, muana wa Ahazaya, munkatshi mua bana ba mukelenge bakadi bashihibue, wakamusokoka ne mulami wandi mu nsubu wa bulalu. Nunku Yehoshabata, muana mukashi wa mukelenge Yeholama, mukashi wa Yehoyada muakuidi (bualu bua yeye wakadi muanʼabo mukashi dî Ahazaya) wakamusokoka kudi Atalaya; nunku yeye kakamushiha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakadi nʼabo musokome mu nsubu wa Nzambi bidimu bisambombo; Atalaya wakadi ukokesha mu buloba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
